#: smartcard.cpp:381
msgid ""
"<h1>smartcard</h1> This module allows you to configure KDE support for "
"smartcards. These can be used for various tasks such as storing SSL "
"certificates and logging in to the system."
msgstr ""
"<h1>smartkaart</h1>"
" Hierdie module laat toe jy na konfigureer Kde ondersteun vir smartkaarte. "
"Hierdie kan wees gebruik word vir verskeie take soos as storing Ssl "
"sertifikate en afteken in na die stelsel."

